      },
      {
        "statement": {
          "_text": "Hmm...If you favor the two-handed mace, I can teach you the Juggernaut Strike. It’s a slow, but immensely powerful strike that has helped me many times against slow, durable foes. If you’ll donate 50 silvers to the “Temple cleanup” fund, I’ll teach you.",
